        <mxCell id="run-start-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Two ways to start the same run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Directly (default):&lt;/b&gt; the dashboard Run button (cloud download) or the ingestion script starts the pipeline as soon as the files are in raw/.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Automatically (optional):&lt;/b&gt; local ingestion uploads a small &quot;ready&quot; file last; EventBridge notices it and the run starter kicks off the pipeline.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(A repeat of an already-published request skips the batch and re-shows that release.)&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="660" x="1030" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
