        <mxCell id="run-leg-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;" value="How a run works" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="400" x="40" y="1230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb0" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="40" y="1269" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Files in S3&lt;/b&gt; – the cloud download (default) or optional local ingestion has put the transactions, accounts and exchange rates in raw/. The run starts directly, or automatically when the &quot;ready&quot; file appears." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="80" y="1265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb1" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="40" y="1319" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Begin&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda) – checks the upload, makes sure only one run happens at a time, and reuses earlier results for identical inputs so we never pay twice. In resume mode it skips stages that already passed after a failed export." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="80" y="1315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb2" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="40" y="1369" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Clean + enrich&lt;/b&gt; (Glue) – converts amounts to USD and works out how each account has been behaving. Skipped if already done." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="80" y="1365" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb3" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="1420" y="1269" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Three jobs at once&lt;/b&gt; (Glue) – the rule baseline (plus an optional new model in SageMaker), BQ1 risk scoring and BQ2 network detection." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="1460" y="1265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb4" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="1420" y="1319" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Double-check + package&lt;/b&gt; (Glue) – recalculates BQ1 and BQ2 separately, measures accuracy and builds the dashboard. It saves checkpoints as it goes and withholds oversized networks as private evidence. Any mismatch stops the run." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="1460" y="1315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lb5" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="28" x="1420" y="1369" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="run-lt5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Publish&lt;/b&gt; (Lambda) – checks the files were not changed, saves a new release and moves a pointer: HI-Large to the main dashboard, everything else to the demo page (?view=demo). If any step fails, the team gets an email (SNS)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1320" x="1460" y="1365" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
